WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.301 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-In a 46-minute video

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.302 size:88% position:44% line:92%
he posted on his Twitter

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.636 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and Facebook last week,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.205 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
once again claimed

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
that last month's presidential
election was rigged.

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.543
Here to talk about it is one
of our writers, Jeff Wright,

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:14.247
in our segment "The Wright Thing
with Jeff Wright."

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:17.484 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:20.086
-What it do, Seth and the
good people of the world?

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:23.790
-So...Jeff, what do you thin
of the president's last post

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.925 size:78% position:39%
-I felt a lot of ways
about the president,

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, when I saw that new post,
I realized

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:31.031
I'm jealous of him, Seth.
-Really, you're jealous?

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes!
He does what he wants,

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
says what he wants,
offends who he wants,

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
and 74 million people
still like him.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.206
-Yeah, but I'm pretty sure
there's 80 million people

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.241 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
who beg to differ.

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:43.777 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-74 million, 80 million.

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know how many people
like me?

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.413 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I don't know.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.347 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Eight.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:48.048 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Actually, seven,

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:51.284
because James is mad at me
for not texting him back,

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:52.552 line:92%
but it's like I get busy.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the truth is
I'm not that busy.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.222 size:81% position:41%
It's just James isn't
that fun to text with.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.191 line:92%
-Really, you're that jealous

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:58.892 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes!

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump may have lost
the election,

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:01.828 line:92%
but Trump is unbeatable, Seth.

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:04.364
He's treating America like it'
a game of "Grand Theft Auto"

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.567
and, far as I'm concerned,
he's beating every mission

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:08.935 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-You really think so?

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:09.402 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes!

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
The man even beat
the COVID mission!

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
If this was really
"Grand Theft Auto,"

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:15.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump and his friends
would have at least five stars

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.010 line:92%
and still not even be arrested

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, even if they did
get arrested,

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.114 line:92%
he would just pardon them.

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.582 line:92%
I'm really jealous of that

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
Imagine being able
to pardon people.

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:27.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, so, if you could
pardon people, you would?

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:28.755 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Damn right I would!

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.123 line:92%
In fact, I'd start with me

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I took
your cup of pencils

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.159 line:92%
and replaced it with a sandwich.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:34.327 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Wait, you did what?

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Took your pencils,
but it's okay.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:37.530 line:92%
As they say in the White House

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
pardon me.
-Oh, that's not how that works

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ English accent ]
A thousand pardons, good sir

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:42.969 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No, not at all.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, Jeff, you shouldn't b
jealous of Donald Trump

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:48.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he's -- So, wait,
you took back your sandwich?

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.510 line:92%
-No, I took your sandwich.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sorry,
but blatant wrongdoing

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.513 line:92%
is part of the Trump plan.

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
And for that,
may I truly be pardoned.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
In the name of the pardon,
the other pardon,

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:58.985 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and the holy pardon.

00:01:58.985 --> 00:01:59.953 line:92%
-Jeff, I'm now pretty sure

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:00.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
you have no idea
what pardoning is

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I can't believe
I'm saying this, but,

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:05.325
you shouldn't just run aroun
acting like the president.

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:06.659 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Of course I should!

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:07.227 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We all should!

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:09.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just make stuff up
and pretend it's the truth

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.930 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you see when Trump
brought out his little graph

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.968
You can tell a graph is the only
way they explain things to him

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.870 line:92%
He's a visual learner, Seth.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.571 line:92%
Which is a polite way of sayin

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.439 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
he can't read.

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.174 line:92%
-Did you believe his graph

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:23.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, no!
But I like that he did.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think a graph
convinced a lot of people.

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:28.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why I came
with my own graph, Seth.

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:31.951
See, this graph right here shows
why I deserve a raise, okay?

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.721 size:75% position:38%
This line represents
America's happiness

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:35.955 line:92%
before I got on your show,

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.724 line:92%
and this is its happiness after.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's an overnight surge
of happiness, Seth.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:42.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you just
make that up yourself?

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.730 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, I did.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:44.597 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just like he did.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.966 line:92%
And I even bought a Sharpie,

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:47.700 size:81% position:41% line:92%
because everyone knows

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
a permanent ink marker
makes it official.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:52.238 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know what?

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:54.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going to give myself
a raise.

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:57.777
-How much money are you
giving yourself per year?

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:58.278 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-$500 million.

00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:01.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
-$500 million?
Come on, Jeff, that's crazy.

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:03.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Crazier than Trump
this past election?

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:04.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ah, fair point.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I'm going
to give myself a PS5,

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:08.288 line:92%
because I deserve it, Seth

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:09.522 line:92%
Look, all I'm trying to say is

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:12.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump has had a run
no one could see coming.

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
How many presidents can sa
they've been impeached,

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:16.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
pardoned their friends
who have committed crimes,

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:18.731 line:92%
and still finished a full term

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:19.532 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Truly inspirational.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I guess that's one way
to look at it.

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:22.769 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Jeff Wright, everybody.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:23.970 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Pardon me?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.771 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Pardon me?

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.940 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Oh, no, sir, pardon me.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.411 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

